There are several goals for which the statistical details are disputed. The goalscorers and timings used here are those of FIFA, the official record. Some other sources, such as RSSSF, state a different scorer, timing, or both.<ref name="MC"/><ref>{{cite web |title=World Cup 1930 finals |publisher=[[RSSSF|Rec.Sport.Soccer Statistics Foundation]] |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/30full.html |accessdate=15 August 2010 |archive-date=2 June 2009 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20090602224814/http://www.rsssf.com/tables/30full.html |url-status=live }}</ref>

